Distillation targets: toroidal κ=k_c·I/V reconstruction head plus drive-ratio identity; conjunctive isolate floor vs continue-firing vs plant ESD; conductivity-infra collusion; electrochemical H2S C=k_h·(I−I0) head plus delta identity; isolate-floor vent vs keep-stripping vs unit-trip; exoneration against last-to-badge social pressure; FMCW L=k_r·Δf and sweep identities; bounded ACCEPT with still-out-of-scope; skip-isolate refusal under survey takt. Agentic value concentrates in three patterns: reconstruction-as-SoT on a physical conductivity/H2S/level the raw corridor cannot see, earned ACCEPT with an explicit physical out-of-scope object (S-1..S-3), and stop-then-hold so a REJECT does not become a plant/unit/dump kill.